<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Holyman buys fast ferry for A$43 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Holyman buys fast ferry for A$43 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian shipping company Holyman Ltd said on Wednesday it had bought the latest fast passenger ferry from Tasmania-based Incat's shipyard for A$43 million to operate between Britain and Belgium.</p>
</text>
